    <briefdescription>
<para>Templated storage wrapper for a callable. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class is consistently default constructible, copy / move constructible / assignable.</para>
<para>Supported callable types:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function" kindref="compound">Function</ref> pointer</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function" kindref="compound">Function</ref> reference</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Lambda</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function" kindref="compound">Function</ref> object </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
